  "scope": "Finite-only virtual classic/BigTIFF reader and reviewed import in C++/Python and both shared ImGui launchers.",
  "semantics": "open_virtual_image_series inspects without pixel decode, retains a guarded source and layout, and returns immutable plane/region providers using the existing supported TIFF profiles. Compressed reads decode only intersected blocks; uncompressed reads fetch requested row columns. Source identity, size and change tokens are checked before/after reads and callbacks; previously returned images remain detached. No persistent decoded provider cache.",
  "limits": "Existing logical sample, encoded-block, codec and file/parser limits remain. Region output and per-read scratch are admitted before allocation, including retained layout and decoded intersected-block buffers. A small region can fit when a full decoded plane cannot. Limits are per read, not aggregate concurrent/process RSS bounds. Full-source finite/corrupt validation remains deferred until accessed; no unsupported format or sample-policy inference.",
  "controls": "Private optional ControlledPlaneSource forwards synchronous execution control across separately linked Python extensions and transparent observer/guard/overlay wrappers. Domain tags avoid duplicate same-domain hooks; callback exceptions and reentry are verified. Public PlaneSource vtable/legacy behavior remains unchanged; this does not qualify arbitrary plugins for internal cancellation.",
  "desktop": "Inspect exposes an explicit virtual-loading checkbox, resets confirmation on mode changes, disables flat import and requires finite-only samples. Closed V16 wraps existing V1-V15 descriptors, restores intent without consent, and requires fresh inspection. Startup stages and revalidates the entire batch atomically. Private metadata-only startup admission retains conservative logical/session-shaped limits without decoding; public session codec remains eager-only.",
  "verification": "4377 selected Python checks per OS, including 845 new API and ten new input checks; eight native suites, eight session groups, three desktop IO/startup/append regression suites, 36 rank-host cases / 499 checks and two resource groups per OS. Fresh installed optional-IO SDK consumers pass. Readers verify 144 reports / 27578 raw input frames, including 20 new reports / 980 frames. Tests cover supported TIFF carriers/codecs/endian/predictors, TCZYXS mapping, intersected-block regions, linked XYZ, bounds, concurrent reads, deferred corrupt/nonfinite failures, source replacement/removal/mutation, detached snapshots, V16 grammar/inert replay/fresh consent, atomic startup, cross-extension checkpoints/cancellation, original Python callback exceptions and reentrant reads. No complete ImageJ/Fiji source/reference/resource/real-GPU/OS-desktop/platform acceptance.",
